# Generated sqlc code

This directory contains type-safe Go code generated from SQL queries.

## Generating Code

Run `make sqlc` or:
```bash
docker-compose exec backend sqlc generate
```

## Files

The following files are auto-generated:
- db.go - Database interface
- models.go - Go structs for database tables
- querier.go - Interface for all queries
- *.sql.go - Query implementations

Do not edit these files manually. Instead, modify the SQL files in `db/queries/` and regenerate.
